# Nutrient classifier model card: nutrient_run1.keras

## Purpose
Classifies an accepted leaf photo as no deficiency or one of four nutrient deficiencies, with a confidence, as one input to fusion. In user-facing messages a nitrogen call is worded "possible nitrogen deficiency".

## Ship status
Verdict: {{models/nutrient_head/manifest.json::ship_verdict}} under the rule fixed before training (`docs/nutrient_ship_rule.md`; source `results/nutrient_run1/nutrient_run1_test/test_decision.json`). This means the rule passed on this dataset. It does not mean deficiency detection works in the field (see Known failure modes).

