## Training
Source: `models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json`, `scripts/train_image_classifier.py` in Colab. EfficientNetB0 with ImageNet weights, two phases: head only (learning rate {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::hyperparameters.lr_head}}), then the last {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::hyperparameters.unfreeze_layers}} base layers unfrozen with BatchNormalization kept frozen (learning rate {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::hyperparameters.lr_finetune}}). Epochs run: phase 1 {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::epochs_run.phase1}}, phase 2 {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::epochs_run.phase2}}. Batch size {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::hyperparameters.batch_size}}, seed {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::hyperparameters.seed}}, balanced class weights, TensorFlow {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::tensorflow_version}}. Best validation accuracy {{models/nutrient_head/run1/training_run.json::best_val_accuracy::.4f}} (the checkpoint was chosen on validation, so validation figures are optimistic). One training run only (decisions in `docs/nutrient_run1_decision.md`).

